{"type":"minecraft:multi_action","title":{"text":"데이터팩 설정"},"body":[{"type":"minecraft:plain_message","contents":"채팅 1회당 떨어질 블록 개수와\n시청자별 쿨타임(초)을 설정합니다"}],"inputs":[{"type":"minecraft:number_range","key":"blocks_per_chat","label":{"text":"소환 개수 설정"},"start":1,"end":6,"step":1,"initial":2},{"type":"minecraft:number_range","key":"cooltime","label":{"text":"쿨타임 설정"},"start":1,"end":60,"step":1,"initial":10},{"type":"minecraft:boolean","key":"is_showing_chat","label":{"text":"채팅 표시"},"initial":true,"on_true":"2","on_false":"1"}],"actions":[{"label":"저장하고 나가기","action":{"type":"minecraft:dynamic/run_command","template":"trigger all_setting set $(cooltime)$(blocks_per_chat)$(is_showing_chat)"}}]}